WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.443
Your chat bots can collect leads, and invites, for you.

2
00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:10.649
Let's open the bot that asks a few questions.

3
00:00:10.949 --> 00:00:12.420
Tap "Leads".

4
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:17.023
Every answer is saved here: their name, their phone, and what they want.

5
00:00:17.324 --> 00:00:21.067
Tap "Download CSV" to open them in a spreadsheet.

6
00:00:21.197 --> 00:00:24.363
Lead questions come with the Starter plan and up.

7
00:00:24.663 --> 00:00:26.912
Now the invite friends bot.

8
00:00:27.042 --> 00:00:29.820
Each person gets their own invite link.

9
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:33.468
When 3 friends join, your bot sends the reward.

10
00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:37.974
Tap "Invites" to see your top inviters, and who got the reward.

11
00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:41.553
Only people new to your bot count, so it stays fair.

12
00:00:41.854 --> 00:00:44.823
Invite friends bots come with the Growth plan.

13
00:00:45.123 --> 00:00:48.130
Want to message everyone who started a bot?

14
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:51.181
Tap "Build", then "📣 Broadcast to these people".

15
00:00:51.482 --> 00:00:56.531
Send a message opens, ready to go, with just the people who started your bot.

16
00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:59.092
Write your message, and send it.

17
00:00:59.222 --> 00:01:02.223
Your bot's people are always one tap away.
